  "question": {
    "text": "A cone of radius R and height H, is hanging inside a liquid of density&nbsp;<math><mrow><mtext>ρ</mtext> </mrow> </math> by means of a string as shown in the figure. The force, due to the liquid acting on the slant surface of the cone is<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0089_729c95c3aeff.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 168px; height: 222px;\" />"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mrow>  <mtext>&rho;</mtext>  <mtext>&pi;</mtext>  <mtext>g</mtext>  <mtext>H</mtext>  <msup>          <mtext>R</mtext>        <mn>2</mn>  </msup></mrow></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mrow>  <mtext>&pi;</mtext>  <mtext>&rho;</mtext>  <mtext>H</mtext>  <msup>          <mtext>R</mtext>        <mn>2</mn>  </msup></mrow></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mrow>  <mfrac>    <mrow>      <mn>4</mn>    </mrow>    <mrow>      <mn>3</mn>    </mrow>  </mfrac>  <mtext>&pi;</mtext>  <mtext>&rho;</mtext>  <mtext>g</mtext>  <mtext>H</mtext>  <msup>          <mtext>R</mtext>        <mn>2</mn>  </msup></mrow></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>3</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <mtext>&pi;</mtext> <mtext>&rho;</mtext> <mtext>g</mtext> <mtext>H</mtext> <msup> <mtext>R</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msup> </mrow> </math>",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Buoyoncy = force on base-force on slant surface (f<sub>​y</sub>)<br /><br />Force on slant surface = force on base-buoyancy<br /><br />Force on slant surface = <math> <mrow> <mtext>&pi;</mtext> <msup> <mtext>R</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mtext>H</mtext> <mtext>&rho;</mtext> <mtext>g</mtext> <mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace> <mo>-</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>3</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <mtext>&pi;</mtext> <msup> <mtext>R</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mtext>H</mtext> <mtext>&rho;</mtext> <mtext>g</mtext> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0089_33f1a9d5bec1.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 142px; height: 221px;\" /><br /><br />Force on slant surface = <math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>3</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <mtext>&pi;</mtext> <msup> <mtext>R</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mtext>H</mtext> <mtext>&rho;</mtext> <mtext>g</mtext> </mrow> </math>"
  }
